      ],
      "exact": [
        "firestore.rules"
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "The whole-diff, cross-file pass. Was `codeReviewGate` until 2026-07-31, i.e. gated on the /code-review BUILTIN — a command only a human can start, so every unattended run (sprint-parallel, /commit, any resume) dead-ended asking Malin to type it. Same filePattern and same marker as before; the only change is that a spawnable agent now owns it. /code-review stays available and is still the deeper pass — it is simply no longer the ONLY way to earn this marker. NOTE the pattern is bare `\\.dart$` on purpose: unlike the code-reviewer gate it does NOT exclude *.g.dart/*.freezed.dart, so a generated-only diff still meets a gate. Do not 'tidy' that exclusion in.",
